ckground:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Community_Loot_List\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Community Loot List\">Community Loot List</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png/420px-Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"234\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>A fine robe of flowing glamerweave. You feel as if your knowledge of trivial matters cannot be bested.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>This item used to be called <a href=\"/page/Item:Lawrence%27s_Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge\" title=\"Item:Lawrence&#39;s Robe of Trivial Knowledge\">Lawrence's Robe of Trivial Knowledge</a>, but was renamed after Menace of the Underdark to remove the name Lawrence. As of Update 28.1.2 (or earlier) this item is now a cosmetic armor.<br /><br />\nSir Lawrence d'Deneith was an event host in the early years of the game.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816223844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.185 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4194/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22500/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4172/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 36/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  172.894      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  172.894      1 -total\n 97.82%  169.122      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 86.70%  149.907     35 Template:IO\n 38.58%   66.697      1 Template:GameRevisionDates\n 30.14%   52.110      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 29.52%   51.039      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 28.63%   49.492      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 27.68%   47.856      2 Template:InCategory\n 12.01%   20.760      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:124810-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816223844 and revision id 681304. Rendering was trigger